# Island of the Magi (Quest 5, Craig Dutton 2012); no published walkthrough -- derived from source.
# No `#!clock` header on purpose: the 20 s underwater / 60 s superstrength / 10 s fire-elemental
# timers never fire without it, so none of the real-time limits apply.
# Dependency chain (win = `use orb on hannicus` in the sanctum):
#   fruit -> invisible bridge; knife (waterfall cave) -> shark -> crate compass; copper key (treehouse)
#   -> casket pearl+ruby; pearl -> Native -> Elder's hut; ruby -> Hermit -> glue + silver key; compass
#   -> Hermit -> ruby back -> monolith. Dragon scale (idol drawer, stone cylinder) + glue -> boat;
#   silver key -> lighthouse shovel + glossy stone -> Elder -> firestone; shovel rows the boat.
#   Pickaxe -> rock -> fossil -> Paleontologist -> dynamite + glass sphere (Water Sprite).
#   Rope + post -> lair; firestone burns the worm -> metal oval. Emerald under the unlit campfire.
#   Dynamite in the temple split + firestone; second firestone use on the hole raises the Fire
#   Elemental, which leaving the temple carries to the Firemagi's chamber. Orchid -> Elder -> berry
#   -> anchor bridges the quagmire -> knife scares the panther -> brass key; knife -> Native -> net
#   -> toad -> crypt gate -> Ghoul (silver key) -> onyx key -> tower. Brass key + metal oval ->
#   pedestal -> hunting horn (Earthmagi). Pepper (kitchen) blinds the Headhunter -> spear; vial
#   venom from the dead rattlesnake poisons it -> Zombie -> diamond; spear kills the Warthog ->
#   lake -> warhammer (Airmagi pillar + Golem). Telescope view 6 reveals the oak; saw -> nest ->
#   sapphire. Four gems on the monolith -> Golem -> orb. Speaking to the 4th freed Magus gives
#   the gold key (sanctum door).
